WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:04.504
With vue-i18n, each
string gets a key,

2
00:00:04.504 --> 00:00:08.241
and your team or a TMS
supplies each language.

3
00:00:08.641 --> 00:00:10.115
It is a mature plugin,

4
00:00:10.115 --> 00:00:13.075
and Nuxt's i18n module builds on it.

5
00:00:13.650 --> 00:00:17.168
General Translation generates
the translations from copy in

6
00:00:17.168 --> 00:00:18.072
your templates.

7
00:00:19.150 --> 00:00:22.946
Your team writes the English inside
a T component in each template.

8
00:00:23.650 --> 00:00:27.911
Then npx gt translate writes
every target locale before the

9
00:00:27.911 --> 00:00:28.409
build.

10
00:00:29.150 --> 00:00:31.518
Reviewers refine the
results in the Dashboard,

11
00:00:31.518 --> 00:00:33.561
with a shared Glossary for terms.

12
00:00:34.150 --> 00:00:36.680
Your team now ships
Spanish with each release.
